#: ../../data-export.rst:2
msgid "Exporting figures"
msgstr "导出图像"

#: ../../data-export.rst:4
msgid ""
"Export includes the visible track drawing, with optional track-name "
"labels. It is **not a screenshot of the entire application**: the "
"toolbar, navigation sidebar and settings popovers are excluded."
msgstr "导出内容包括可见的轨道绘图，并可选择显示轨道名称标签。它  不是整个应用的屏幕截图  ：工具栏、导航侧栏和设置弹窗不会包含在内。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:9
msgid "Step-by-step example"
msgstr "分步示例"

#: ../../data-export.rst:11
msgid ""
"Arrange your loci, for example ``ACTB, EGFR, TP53, MYC`` in four panels "
"(see :doc:`navigation`)."
msgstr "将位点安排到四个面板中，例如 ``ACTB, EGFR, TP53, MYC`` （见  :doc:`navigation`  ）。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:13
msgid ""
"Choose the desired gene expansion state, colours and signal scale. Hide "
"tracks you do not need using the sidebar checkboxes."
msgstr "选择所需的基因展开状态、颜色和信号量程。使用侧栏复选框隐藏不需要的轨道。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:15
msgid ""
"Click **Export** in the toolbar. Leave **Include left track names** "
"checked to retain the track-name column; clear it for a drawing-only "
"figure."
msgstr "点击工具栏中的  导出  。保留勾选  包含左侧轨道名称  以保留轨道名称列；清除后将只导出绘图。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:17
msgid ""
"Choose **PNG**, **SVG** or **PDF**. Wait for the export-complete "
"notification and use the normal download/save location for your browser "
"or desktop build."
msgstr "选择  PNG  、  SVG  或  PDF  。等待导出完成通知，并使用浏览器或桌面版的常规下载/保存位置。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:19
msgid ""
"Inspect the exported file before adding it to a manuscript: check labels,"
" each panel's locus, and whether the signal scales should be comparable."
msgstr "将导出的文件加入论文前先检查：核对标签、每个面板的位点，以及信号量程是否应保持可比。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:22
msgid "Export menu offering track-name labels PNG SVG and PDF for four loci"
msgstr "显示四个位点及轨道名称标签、PNG、SVG 和 PDF 选项的导出菜单"

#: ../../data-export.rst:26
msgid ""
"Actual Export menu for a multi-gene view. The include-labels checkbox "
"controls the track-name column, not the application sidebar."
msgstr "多基因视图中的实际导出菜单。包含标签复选框控制的是轨道名称列，而不是应用侧栏。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:29
msgid "Exported four-locus plot without the application toolbar or sidebar"
msgstr "不含应用工具栏或侧栏的四位点导出图"

#: ../../data-export.rst:33
msgid ""
"Example plot composed from the same four panels. It retains the genomic "
"tracks but omits the toolbar and application sidebar."
msgstr "由相同四个面板组成的示例图。它保留基因组轨道，但省略工具栏和应用侧栏。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:37
msgid "Choose a format"
msgstr "选择格式"

#: ../../data-export.rst:43
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

#: ../../data-export.rst:44
msgid "Best use"
msgstr "最佳用途"

#: ../../data-export.rst:45
msgid "What to expect"
msgstr "预期效果"

#: ../../data-export.rst:46
msgid "PNG"
msgstr "PNG"

#: ../../data-export.rst:47
msgid "Slides, email, documents"
msgstr "幻灯片、电子邮件、文档"

#: ../../data-export.rst:48
msgid ""
"The app renders a 2× raster plot. Pixel dimensions, not a DPI label "
"alone, determine how much detail it contains."
msgstr "应用会渲染一张 2× 栅格图。图像包含多少细节取决于像素尺寸，而不仅是 DPI 标签。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:50
msgid "SVG"
msgstr "SVG"

#: ../../data-export.rst:51
msgid "Editable illustration"
msgstr "可编辑插图"

#: ../../data-export.rst:52
msgid ""
"Vector exon blocks, arrows, signal primitives and text. Open in a vector "
"editor to adjust individual objects; keep the original file."
msgstr "矢量外显子块、箭头、信号图元和文本。在矢量编辑器中打开即可调整单个对象；请保留原始文件。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:54
msgid "PDF"
msgstr "PDF"

#: ../../data-export.rst:55
msgid "Publication or sharing"
msgstr "发表或分享"

#: ../../data-export.rst:56
msgid ""
"Vector drawing with an embedded system font when available. If font "
"loading fails, Orbit explicitly falls back to a raster PDF."
msgstr "在系统字体可用时使用嵌入字体的矢量图。如果字体加载失败，Orbit 会明确回退为栅格 PDF。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:60
msgid "PNG resolution and 300 DPI"
msgstr "PNG 分辨率与 300 DPI"

#: ../../data-export.rst:62
msgid ""
"For a 300-DPI figure, required pixels = printed width in inches × 300. A "
"12.8-inch-wide figure needs 3840 pixels. Merely changing a 1280-pixel "
"image's DPI metadata does not create more detail. Prefer SVG/PDF when you"
" need arbitrary rescaling. The manual's new screenshots were captured at "
"3× device scale and saved with 300-DPI metadata; that is separate from "
"the app's 2× PNG export."
msgstr ""
"对于 300 DPI 的图像，所需像素数 = 印刷宽度（英寸）× 300。宽 12.8 英寸的图像需要 3840 像素。仅修改 1280 "
"像素图像的 DPI 元数据不会增加细节。需要任意缩放时优先使用 SVG/PDF。手册中新截图以 3× 设备缩放比例截取，并保存了 300 DPI "
"元数据；这与应用的 2× PNG 导出是两回事。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:69
msgid "What is included"
msgstr "导出内容"

#: ../../data-export.rst:71
msgid ""
"Visible tracks are composed in their screen order, including imported "
"BAM, signal, annotation and FASTA tracks. Multi-panel plots retain all "
"panel drawing regions. Hidden tracks are omitted. Track names are "
"optional; settings menus are not exported. A plot is more reliable than a"
" whole-window screenshot when you want only the genomic data."
msgstr ""
"可见轨道按屏幕顺序合成，包括导入的 BAM、信号、注释和 FASTA "
"轨道。多面板图会保留所有面板绘图区域。隐藏轨道会被省略。轨道名称可选；设置菜单不会导出。只需要基因组数据时，绘图比整个窗口的屏幕截图更可靠。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:77
msgid ""
"The SVG/PDF renderer replays the drawing into vector primitives rather "
"than embedding a screen bitmap. Signal rendering can produce many "
"rectangles or paths; do not assume it is one editable path per sample. "
"Fonts and labels should still be checked in the target illustration "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"SVG/PDF "
"渲染器会将绘图重新绘制为矢量图元，而不是嵌入屏幕位图。信号渲染可能生成许多矩形或路径；不要假定每个样本只有一条可编辑路径。在目标插图编辑器中仍应检查字体和标签。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:82
msgid ""
"There is no separate batch-export interface. To export several loci "
"together, use up to **five panels** and export once; for separate "
"figures, navigate and export one locus at a time."
msgstr "没有独立的批量导出界面。要一次导出多个位点，最多使用  五个面板  后导出；若需分别成图，请逐个位点导航并导出。"

